__pycache__/
*.pyc
state/pool_candidates.json
# state/*.json are TRACKED: main holds a frozen snapshot that the Brain build reads,
# and the GitHub Actions poller persists its live copy on the bot-state branch
# (ops/state-branch.sh). pool_candidates.json stays ignored — it's regenerated
# every run and feeds the /queue publish; brain/build_cells.py also reads it when
# present, so the Brain nightly refuses to publish while it exists.
